#: data/org.gnome.Sudoku.appdata.xml.in:7
msgid "GNOME Sudoku"
msgstr "GNOME Sudoku"

#: data/org.gnome.Sudoku.appdata.xml.in:8 data/org.gnome.Sudoku.desktop.in:4
msgid "Test your logic skills in this number grid puzzle"
msgstr "Łōmigōwka cyfrowo, co testuje logiczne myślynie"

#: data/org.gnome.Sudoku.appdata.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Play the popular Japanese logic game. GNOME Sudoku is a must-install for "
"Sudoku lovers, with a simple, unobtrusive interface that makes playing "
"Sudoku fun for players of any skill level."
msgstr ""
"Popularne japōńske łōmigōwki logiczne. Gra GNOME Sudoku je przeznaczōno dlo "
"wszyjskich miyłośnikōw Sudoku, a jeji ajnfachowy, prosty w użyciu interfejs "
"czyni gra przijymno dlo groczy kożdyj klasy.."

#: data/org.gnome.Sudoku.appdata.xml.in:15
msgid ""
"Each game is assigned a difficulty similar to those given by newspapers and "
"websites, so your game will be as easy or as difficult as you want it to be."
msgstr ""
"Kożdo plansza mo przidzielōny poziōm ciynżkości podobny do tych z cajtōngōw "
"i placōw internetowych, tōż idzie ôbrać plansza tak trudno, jak sie chce."

#: data/org.gnome.Sudoku.appdata.xml.in:20
msgid ""
"If you like to play on paper, you can print games out. You can choose how "
"many games you want to print per page and what difficulty of games you want "
"to print: as a result, GNOME Sudoku can act a renewable Sudoku book for you."
msgstr ""
"Idzie tyż durkować plansze, coby grać na papiōrze. Idzie ôbrać wielość "
"plansz na strōna i jejich poziōm. Gra GNOME Sudoku może tōż być używano za "
"ôdnowialno ksiōnżka do Sudoku."

#: data/org.gnome.Sudoku.appdata.xml.in:30
msgid "A GNOME sudoku game preview"
msgstr "Podglōnd szpilu GNOME Sudoku"

#: data/org.gnome.Sudoku.appdata.xml.in:78
msgid "The GNOME Project"
msgstr ""

